  "extract": "Washington, D.C., officially the District of Columbia and commonly shortened to  Washington, or DC, is the capital city of the United States, and its only federal district.\nThe city stands on the northeast bank of the Potomac River, across from the state of Virginia, surrounded by Maryland to its north, east, and south.",
